	RETURN 0
IF CFLAG:(ARG:1):気合フラグ || CFLAG:(ARG:1):타인기합플래그
	PRINTFORM 　　TARGET:[{CPOS(ARG:1),2}] %CALLNAME:(ARG:1),20,LEFT%　>>>>>>　
	PRINTW 기합을 저해!
	CFLAG:(ARG:1):気合フラグ = 0
	CFLAG:(ARG:1):타인기합플래그 = 0
ENDIF
IF CFLAG:(ARG:1):집중플래그 || CFLAG:(ARG:1):타인집중플래그
	PRINTFORM 　　TARGET:[{CPOS(ARG:1),2}] %CALLNAME:(ARG:1),20,LEFT%　>>>>>>　
	PRINTW 집중을 저해!
	CFLAG:(ARG:1):집중플래그 = 0
	CFLAG:(ARG:1):타인집중플래그 = 0
ENDIF

